msgstr "Valikud"

#: prefs.js:324
msgid "Kiwi"
msgstr "Kiwi"

#: prefs.js:325
msgid ""
"Kiwi is not like Apple, it's free open source project that brings macOS-like "
"feel for GNOME"
msgstr ""
"Kiwi ei ole Apple – see on vaba avatud lähtekoodiga projekt, mis annab GNOME-"
"le macOS-i sarnase tunde"

#: prefs.js:331 prefs.js:338
msgid "Panel Transparency"
msgstr "Paneeli läbipaistvus"

#: prefs.js:332
msgid "Configure panel transparency and appearance"
msgstr "Seadista paneeli läbipaistvust ja välimust"

#: prefs.js:339
msgid "Make the top panel transparent"
msgstr "Muuda ülemine paneel läbipaistvaks"

#: prefs.js:347
msgid "Transparency Level"
msgstr "Läbipaistvuse tase"

#: prefs.js:348
msgid "Set panel transparency (0-100)"
msgstr "Paneeli läbipaistvuse väärtus (0–100)"

#: prefs.js:362
msgid "Opaque When Window Touches"
msgstr "Läbipaistmatu kui aken puudutab"

#: prefs.js:363
msgid "Make panel opaque when a window touches it"
msgstr "Muuda paneel läbipaistmatuks, kui aken seda puudutab"

#: prefs.js:371
msgid "Panel Blur"
msgstr "Paneeli hägustamine"

#: prefs.js:372
msgid "Blur the background behind the panel"
msgstr "Hägusta paneeli taust"

#: prefs.js:380
msgid "Panel Color Fix"
msgstr "Paneeli värviparandus"

#: prefs.js:381
msgid "Fix white panel on some themes (e.g., Ubuntu Yaru)"
msgstr "Paranda valge paneel mõnes teemas (nt Ubuntu Yaru)"

#: prefs.js:414
msgid "Move Window to New Workspace"
msgstr "Liiguta aken uuele tööalale"

#: prefs.js:414
msgid "Move fullscreen window to a new workspace"
msgstr "Liiguta täisekraan aken uuele tööalale"

#: prefs.js:415
msgid "Transparent Move"
msgstr "Läbipaistev liigutamine"

#: prefs.js:415
msgid "Move window with transparency"
msgstr "Liiguta akent läbipaistvusega"

#: prefs.js:416
msgid "Battery Percentage"
msgstr "Aku protsent"

#: prefs.js:416
msgid "Show battery percentage in the top bar when below 20%"
msgstr "Näita aku protsenti ülaribal, kui see on alla 20%"

#: prefs.js:417
msgid "Move Calendar to Right"
msgstr "Liiguta kalender paremale"

#: prefs.js:417
msgid "Move calendar to right side and hide notifications"
msgstr "Liiguta kalender paremale ja peida teavitused"

#: prefs.js:418
msgid "Show Window Title"
msgstr "Näita akna pealkirja"

#: prefs.js:418
msgid "Display current window title in the top panel"
msgstr "Kuva praeguse akna pealkiri ülemisel paneelil"

#: prefs.js:419
msgid "Show Panel on Hover"
msgstr "Näita paneeli hiire läheduse korral"

#: prefs.js:419
msgid ""
"Show panel when mouse is near top edge in fullscreen. Bugged for GTK4 apps."
msgstr ""
"Näita paneeli, kui hiir on täisekraanil ülemise serva lähedal. GTK4 "
"rakendustes võib esineda tõrkeid."

#: prefs.js:420
msgid "Show Window Controls on Panel"
msgstr "Näita aknajuhtnuppe paneelil"

#: prefs.js:420
msgid ""
"Display close, minimize, maximize buttons in the top panel when window is "
"maximized"
msgstr ""
"Kuva üleval paneelil sulgemise, minimeerimise ja maksimeerimise nupud, kui "
"aken on maksimeeritud"

#: prefs.js:421
msgid "Overview Wallpaper Blur"
msgstr "Ülevaate tausta hägusus"

#: prefs.js:421
msgid ""
"Use blurred current wallpaper as overview background (requires ImageMagick)"
msgstr ""
"Kasuta hägustatud praegust taustapilti ülevaate taustana (vajab ImageMagicki)"

#: prefs.js:422
msgid "Dock Blur"
msgstr "Doki hägustamine"

#: prefs.js:422
msgid "Blur the background behind Dash-to-Dock"
msgstr "Hägusta Dash-to-Docki taust"

#: prefs.js:445
msgid "Keep GNOME Notification Panel"
msgstr "Säilita GNOME märguannete paneel"

#: prefs.js:446
msgid "Don't split notification and calendar layout"
msgstr "Ära eralda märguannete ja kalendri paigutust"

#: prefs.js:452
msgid "Indicator Style"
msgstr "Näidiku stiil"

#: prefs.js:453
msgid "Notification dot recolor"
msgstr "Märguandepunkti värvimine"

#: prefs.js:463 prefs.js:562
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Vaikimisi"

#: prefs.js:467
msgid "Accent"
msgstr "Aktsentvärv"

#: prefs.js:471
msgid "Symbolic"
msgstr "Sümboolne"

#: prefs.js:498
msgid "ImageMagick not installed (install package \"imagemagick\" to enable)"
msgstr ""
"ImageMagick ei ole paigaldatud (paigalda pakett \"imagemagick\", et lubada)"

#: prefs.js:507
msgid "Window Control Button Style"
msgstr "Akna juhtnuppude stiil"

#: prefs.js:508
msgid ""
"Choose the window control button style. Log out to apply it across all apps."
msgstr ""
"Vali akna juhtnuppude stiil. Logi välja, et rakendada kõigis rakendustes."

#: prefs.js:514
msgid "Enable macOS Window Buttons"
msgstr "Luba macOS-i aknanupud"

#: prefs.js:515
msgid "Replace window control buttons in application windows with macOS style"
msgstr "Asenda rakenduste akende juhtnupud macOSi stiiliga"

#: prefs.js:532
msgid "Firefox Styling"
msgstr "Firefoxi stiil"

#: prefs.js:533
msgid ""
"Apply macOS window control styling for Firefox. Recommended to use with "
"vertical tabs."
msgstr ""
"Rakenda Firefoxile macOS-i aknanuppude stiil. Soovitatav koos vertikaalsete "
"kaartidega."

#: prefs.js:541
msgid "Thunderbird Styling"
msgstr "Thunderbirdi stiil"

#: prefs.js:542
msgid "Apply macOS window control styling for Thunderbird."
msgstr "Rakenda macOSi akna juhtnuppude stiil Thunderbirdile."

#: prefs.js:551
msgid "Button Type"
msgstr "Nupu tüüp"

#: prefs.js:552
msgid "Choose the button icon set"
msgstr "Vali nupu ikoonide komplekt"

#: prefs.js:566
msgid "Alternative"
msgstr "Alternatiivne"

#: prefs.js:583
msgid "Button Size"
msgstr "Nupu suurus"

#: prefs.js:584
msgid "Choose button size"
msgstr "Vali nupu suurus"

#: prefs.js:594
msgid "Small"
msgstr "Väike"

#: prefs.js:598
msgid "Normal"
msgstr "Tavaline"

#: prefs.js:631
msgid "Extras"
msgstr "Lisad"

#: prefs.js:637
msgid "Extra Features"
msgstr "Lisafunktsioonid"

#: prefs.js:638
msgid "Additional customization options and utilities"
msgstr "Täiendavad kohandamisvõimalused ja tööriistad"

#: prefs.js:643
msgid "Add Username"
msgstr "Lisa kasutajanimi"

#: prefs.js:643
msgid "Add username to the quick menu"
msgstr "Lisa kasutajanimi kiirmenüüsse"

#: prefs.js:644
msgid "Caps Lock and Num Lock"
msgstr "Caps Lock ja Num Lock"

#: prefs.js:644
msgid "Show Caps Lock and Num Lock icon"
msgstr "Näita Caps Locki ja Num Locki ikooni"

#: prefs.js:645
msgid "Hide Activities Button"
msgstr "Peida Tegevused nupp"

#: prefs.js:645
msgid "Hide the Activities button in the top panel"
msgstr "Peida ülemise paneeli Tegevuste nupp"

#: prefs.js:646
msgid "Hide Minimized Windows"
msgstr "Peida minimeeritud aknad"

#: prefs.js:646
msgid "Hide minimized windows in the overview"
msgstr "Peida minimeeritud aknad ülevaates"

#: prefs.js:647
msgid "Skip to Desktop"
msgstr "Liigu otse töölauale"

#: prefs.js:647
msgid "Do not show the overview when logging in. Animation is still visible"
msgstr "Ära näita sisselogimisel ülevaadet. Animatsioon jääb nähtavaks."

#: prefs.js:648
msgid "Custom Do Not Disturb Button"
msgstr "Kohandatud mitte segada nupp"

#: prefs.js:648
msgid ""
"Replace the system Do Not Disturb button with Kiwi's custom implementation"
msgstr "Asendab süsteemi mitte segada nupu Kiwi kohandatud toteutusega"

#: prefs.js:663
msgid "Launchpad Application"
msgstr "Launchpadi rakendus"

#: prefs.js:664
msgid ""
"Add custom Launchpad icon to dock that opens application overview. "
"Recommended to hide default app launcher."
msgstr ""
"Lisa dokki kohandatud Launchpadi ikoon, mis avab rakenduste ülevaate. "
"Soovitatav on peita vaikimisi käivitaja."

#: prefs.js:681
msgid "Custom Icon"
msgstr "Kohandatud ikoon"

#: prefs.js:684 prefs.js:769
msgid "Using default icon"
msgstr "Kasutatakse vaikeikooni"

#: prefs.js:692
msgid "Reset to default icon"
msgstr "Lähtesta vaikeikoonile"

#: prefs.js:703
msgid "Browse for icon"
msgstr "Vali ikoon"

#: prefs.js:708
msgid "Select Launchpad Icon"
msgstr "Vali Launchpadi ikoon"

#: prefs.js:712
msgid "Images (PNG, SVG)"
msgstr "Pildid (PNG, SVG)"

#: prefs.js:740
msgid "Icon Too Large"
msgstr "Ikoon on liiga suur"

#: prefs.js:741
msgid ""
"The selected image exceeds 512×512 pixels. Please choose a smaller image."
msgstr "Valitud pilt ületab 512×512 pikslit. Palun vali väiksem pilt."

#: prefs.js:743
msgid "OK"
msgstr "Sobib"

#: prefs.js:775
msgid "Style Keyboard Indicator"
msgstr "Kohanda klaviatuuri indikaatorit"

#: prefs.js:776
msgid ""
"Slightly style keyboard/input source indicator by converting to uppercase "
"and adding border"
msgstr ""
"Muuda klaviatuuri/sisendallika indikaatorit veidi, muutes selle "
"suurtähtedeks ja lisades raami"

#: prefs.js:784
msgid "Hide keyboard indicator"
msgstr "Peida klaviatuuri indikaator"

#: prefs.js:785
msgid "Completely hide the indicator from the panel"
msgstr "Peida indikaator paneelilt täielikult"

#: prefs.js:821
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Täpsemad"

#: prefs.js:851
msgid "Titlebuttons Hover Effect for GTK3 apps"
msgstr "GTK3 aknanuppude hõljutusefekt"

#: prefs.js:862
msgid ""
"The titlebuttons hover module provides macOS-like hover effects for window "
"controls in GTK3 applications. GTK3 apps cannot natively show hover effects "
"on all three window controls simultaneously, requiring this custom library "
"to achieve the desired behavior.\n"
"\n"
"This binary code cannot be distributed through the GNOME Extensions platform "
"due to security policies regarding native libraries, but manual installation "
"is possible."
msgstr ""
"Aknanuppude hõljutusmoodul pakub macOS-i sarnaseid hõljutusefekte GTK3 "
"rakenduste aknajuhtnuppudele. GTK3 rakendused ei suuda kõiki kolme aknanuppu "
"korraga hõljutusefektiga kuvada, mistõttu on soovitud käitumise "
"saavutamiseks vaja seda teeki.\n"
"\n"
"Seda binaari ei saa GNOME laienduste platvormil levitada kohalike teekide "
"turvapoliitika tõttu, kuid käsitsi paigaldus on võimalik."

#: prefs.js:874
msgid "Installation Guide on GitHub"
msgstr "Paigaldusjuhend GitHubis"

#: prefs.js:876
msgid "Open the advanced module build instructions"
msgstr "Ava täiendmooduli koostejuhised"

#: prefs.js:881
msgid "Even more..."
msgstr "Veelgi enam…"

#: prefs.js:885
msgid "AppManager"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:887
msgid "MacOS style AppImage installer and management application"
msgstr "MacOS-stiilis AppImage'ide paigaldus- ja haldusrakendus"

#: prefs.js:890
msgid "MacTahoe Icon Pack"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:892
msgid "macOS Tahoe icon theme for Linux"
msgstr "macOS Tahoe ikooniteema Linuxile"

#: prefs.js:895
msgid "GDM Wallpaper"
msgstr ""

#: prefs.js:897
msgid "Set custom GDM login screen wallpaper"
msgstr "Määra kohandatud GDMi sisselogimisekraani taustapilt"

#: prefs.js:905
msgid "Recommended Extensions"
msgstr "Soovitatud laiendused"

#: prefs.js:906
msgid "Extensions that are compatible with Kiwi"
msgstr "Kiwi-ga ühilduvad laiendused"

